nth":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1003","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[19,6,76,74,72,67],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"98","reputation":"3750","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007802","armor":"WP1017505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1011","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[19,6,76,74,72,67],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"98","reputation":"3750","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007802","armor":"WP1017505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[19,6,76,74,72,67],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3100","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007802","armor":"WP1017505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1011","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[19,6,76,74,72,67],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3100","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007802","armor":"WP1017505"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"汉末名士。出身九江大族，是名震江淮的辩论家与清谈名士，其辩才与孔融、祢衡等汉末清流齐名，但更具务实精神。赤壁之战前充当曹操之说客，企图劝说周瑜投降。而当时周瑜将计就计，诱导他盗走假的张、蔡二人的“投降书”，以反间计除去了这二人。蒋干自以为立功，却成为了笑柄。","tc":"漢末名士。出身九江大族，是名震江淮的辯論家與清談名士，其辯才與孔融、禰衡等漢末清流齊名，但更具務實精神。赤壁之戰前充當曹操之說客，企圖勸說周瑜投降。而當時周瑜將計就計，誘導他盜走假的張、蔡二人的“投降書”，以反間計除去了這二人。蔣干自以為立功，卻成為了笑柄。","en":"A famous late-Han scholar. Born into a prominent family of Jiujiang, he was a debater and scholar of pure conversation whose fame shook the Jiang-Huai region, his eloquence rivaled that of late-Han luminaries such as Kong Rong and Mi Heng, though he possessed a more pragmatic spirit. Before the Battle of Red Cliffs, he served as Cao Cao's envoy, attempting to persuade Zhou Yu to surrender. Zhou Yu, however, turned his own scheme against him, misleading him into stealing a forged ‘letter of surrender’ from Zhang Yun and Cai Mao, using a counter-espionage stratagem to eliminate the two. Jiang Gan believed he had rendered great service, but instead became a laughingstock.","jp":"後漢末期の名士。九江の大族の出身で、江淮に名を轟かせた弁論家にして清談の名士。その弁舌は孔融や禰衡ら後漢末の清流派と肩を並べたが、より実務的な精神を備えていた。赤壁の戦いの前には曹操の説客を務め、周瑜を説き伏せて降伏させようと試みた。しかし周瑜に計略を逆手に取られ、偽りの張・蔡両名の「降伏状」を盗み出すよう誘導され、離間の計によってこの二人を始末される結果となった。蒋幹は功を立てたつもりでいたが、かえって物笑いの種となった。","kr":"한말의 명사이다. 구강의 대족 출신으로, 강회에 명성을 떨친 변론가이자 청담 명사였다. 웅변가로서 공융, 예형 등 한말 청류와 어깨를 나란히 했으나 보다 실무적인 기풍을 지녔다. 적벽대전 직전 조조의 유세객이 되어 주유에게 항복을 권유하려 했다. 그러나 당시 주유가 계책을 역이용하여 장윤과 채모 두 사람의 위조된 '항복서'를 훔치도록 유도했고, 반간계로 이들을 제거했다. 장간은 자신이 공을 세운 줄 알았으나 도리어 세간의 웃음거리가 되고 말았다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10189","remark":"","surname":"蒋","surnameTc":"蔣","surnameEn":"Jiang","surnameJp":"蒋","surnameKr":"장","surnameOther":"","name":"干","nameTc":"干","nameEn":"Gan","nameJp":"干","nameKr":"간","nameOther":"","word":"子翼","wordTc":"子翼","wordEn":"Ziyi","wordJp":"子翼","wordKr":"자익","wordOther":"","icon":"蒋干","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"194","city":"CS1040","gender":"0","rule":"19","force":"6","wise":"76","politics":"74","charm":"72","will":"67","ruleTalent":"1","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"7","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"1/1/1/1/1/66/15/1","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1005102;1005705","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"300","battleSoulPoint":"0","debateSoulPoint":"4300","strategy":"1004008","strategy2":"","professions":"0/0/0/0/0/0/0/3/1/3/0/0/0/0/0/0/3/5/2/0/0/1/3/2","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"22","loyalty":"0","reputation"